    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d254">

                <pb facs="0364" n="344" sameAs="frus:frus1950v07/pg344"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">795.00/7–1050: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in the United Kingdom</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Holmes</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">top secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">niact</hi>
                        
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1950-07-10T17:00:00+01:00">July 10, 1950—5 p.
                            m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received July 10—12:50 p. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>184. Eyes only for the Secretary. Re Embtel
                    175 repeated Moscow 12,<anchor n="1" xml:id="d254-f1"/> saw Younger instead of
                        Strang<anchor n="2" xml:id="d254-f2"/> this afternoon who said that your <pb
                        facs="0365" n="345" xml:id="pg345"/> comments (Deptel 123)<anchor n="3"
                        xml:id="d254-f3"/> would be incorporated one way or another in a follow-up
                    message being sent to Kelly. This message would also give Kelly green light to
                    go ahead. Hope to be able cable you text this message later today.</p>
                <p>Repeated Moscow 14, eyes only for Ambassador; Department pass Moscow.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Holmes</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d254-f1" n="1" xml:id="d254-f1-content">
