                    <hi rendition="#italic">Infra</hi>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d254-f2" n="2" xml:id="d254-f2-content">
                <p>Sir William Strang, Permanent Under Secretary of State in the British Foreign
                    Office.</p>
            </note>
